:: StoryTitle
Pronouns for SugarCube: demo

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "7B1E2C4A-5D3F-4E8B-9A61-2F0C8D4B7E35",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.37.3",
